RustChamber
============

Portions of the layout, component structure, measurements and interaction behaviour are
translated from OpenChamber v2.6.0:

  https://github.com/openchamber/openchamber
  Copyright (c) 2025 Bohdan Triapitsyn
  Licensed under the MIT License. See licenses/OpenChamber-MIT.txt.

The Rust/egui implementation is original work distributed under the MIT License.

OpenCode (https://opencode.ai) is a separate project and is not bundled with this
repository's source. It is used at runtime as an external server.

Icons
-----

Icon shapes are derived from Rust/UI Icons (https://rust-ui.com/icons), licensed under the
